..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : PRICEMAINTENANCE.BUAPPLY.BA
.. Autor          : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : tiwe
.. Functionality  : Gives note in status bar if table is empty. If not this
.. calls subroutine that applys data into table according to the global changing
.. instructions in the header fo the infosystem.
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.continue APPLY ? _F|empty(M|tzeilen)
.input "is/STATUS.EMPTY.TABLE"
.continue END
..
!APPLY
.input 'M|increaseall' ? _F|empty(M|increaseall)
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
